webm 	WebM
--- ffmpeg -f 
3g2 	QuickTime / MOV
3gp 	QuickTime / MOV
concat 	Virtual concatenation script
image2 	image2 sequence
lavfi 	Libavfilter virtual input device
m4a 	QuickTime / MOV
matroska 	Matroska / WebM
mj2 	QuickTime / MOV
mov 	QuickTime / MOV
mp4 	QuickTime / MOV
webm 	Matroska / WebM
--- ffmpeg -h 
bsf=	the options of a bitstream filter
decoder=	the options of a decoder
demuxer=	the options of a demuxer
encoder=	the options of an encoder
filter=	the options of a filter
full 	all the options, also of formats and codecs
long 	more options
muxer=	the options of a muxer
protocol=	the options of a protocol
--- ffmpeg -h muxer=
muxer=image2 	image2 sequence
muxer=matroska 	Matroska
muxer=mov 	QuickTime / MOV
muxer=mp3 	MP3 (MPEG audio layer 3)
muxer=mp4 	MP4 (MPEG-4 Part 14)
muxer=null 	raw null video
muxer=webm 	WebM
=== values
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -c:v libx264 -aq-mode 
autovariance 	auto-variance AQ
autovariance-biased 	auto-variance AQ with bias to dark scenes
none 
variance 	variance AQ (complexity mask)
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -f mp4 -movflags 
cmaf	write CMAF compatible fragmented MP4
default_base_moof	set the default-base-is-moof flag in tfhd atoms
empty_moov	make the initial moov atom empty
faststart	run a second pass to put the index (moov atom) at the beginning of the file
frag_keyframe	fragment at video keyframes
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -f mp4 -movflags +faststart+frag_
+faststart+frag_keyframe	fragment at video keyframes
--- ffmpeg -fflags +gen
+genpts	generate pts
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -fflags 
autobsf	add needed bsfs automatically
bitexact	do not write random/volatile data
flush_packets	reduce the latency by flushing out packets immediately
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -strict 
experimental 	allow non-standardized experimental things
normal 
strict 	strictly conform to all the things in the spec no matter what the consequences
unofficial 	allow unofficial extensions
very 	strictly conform to a older more strict version of the spec or reference software
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -pix_fmt 
nv12 	3 components, 12 bits per pixel
rgb24 	3 components, 24 bits per pixel
yuv420p 	3 components, 12 bits per pixel
yuv420p10le 	3 components, 15 bits per pixel
yuv444p 	3 components, 24 bits per pixel
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -sample_fmt 
dbl 	64 bits
dblp 	64 bits, planar
flt 	32 bits
fltp 	32 bits, planar
s16 	16 bits
s16p 	16 bits, planar
s32 	32 bits
s32p 	32 bits, planar
s64 	64 bits
s64p 	64 bits, planar
u8 	8 bits
u8p 	8 bits, planar
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -ch_layout 
5.1 	FL+FR+FC+LFE+BL+BR
7.1 	FL+FR+FC+LFE+BL+BR+SL+SR
mono 	FC
stereo 	FL+FR
--- ffmpeg -i in.mp4 -ch_layout FL+
FL+BL 	back left
FL+BR 	back right
FL+FC 	front center
FL+FL 	front left
FL+FR 	front right
FL+LFE 	low frequency
