--- ffmpeg -loglevel repeat+
repeat+datetime+	prefix each message with the date and time
repeat+debug 	everything, also debugging information
repeat+error 	errors
repeat+fatal 	only errors after which ffmpeg can't go on
repeat+info 	the default
repeat+level+	prefix each message with its level
repeat+panic 	only errors that crash the process
repeat+quiet 	show nothing
repeat+time+	prefix each message with the time
repeat+trace 	everything
repeat+verbose 	more than info
repeat+warning 	warnings and errors
